# M1 and later migration private workspaces (does not remove already tracked files)
**/.m1-private/
**/.clasp.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*credentials.private.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*.private.pem
**/*.private.key
**/mupdf-migration-private-fixtures/

# M2: generated AGPL build assets are private until legal release gate clears
**/.m2-private/
**/node_modules/
study-note/mupdf-migration/m2/dist/
**/m2-private-output/

# M3 isolated browser render screenshot/synthetic fixtures only
**/.m3-private/

# M4 loopback-only QA outputs and synthetic screenshot; never publish.
**/.m4-private/

# M5 loopback-only synthetic QA outputs. Never commit screenshots or private data.
**/.m5-private/

# M6 local synthetic browser output; never publish private session artifacts.
**/.m6-private/

# R5 independent C source / Emsdk / any build output, never publish
**/.r5-private/
# R6: local-only verified public-release rehearsal assets; never track binaries.
**/.r6-private/
# R7: no licensed JS/WASM build output, test data or source staging in Git.
**/.r7-private/
# R8: isolated read-only deployed Apps Script snapshots and signed release inputs.
**/.r8-private/
